---
type: readme
title: Ozone platform implementations overview
summary: Describes the directory as containing Ozone platform implementations of the ui/ozone/public interfaces for Chromium and points to docs/ozone_overview.md for details.
---

This directory contains implementations of platforms. Each platform implements
the interfaces from ui/ozone/public for the rest of chromium.

See docs/ozone_overview.md for details.
